cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "MS1Match" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'MS1Match: MS1Match for Library-guided Annotation and Grouping of Re-dundant
  MS1 Features in LC-MS Untargeted Metabolomics'
version: 1.0.0
abstract: Annotates redundant MS1 features in LC-MS untargeted metabolomics (adducts,
  isotopes and in-source fragments) by matching them to an MS1 reference library built
  from pure standards. Features are grouped per compound and assigned to evidence
  tiers, optionally supported by MS2 fragment matching. The resulting reference groups
  can be used to benchmark feature-grouping tools.
authors:
- family-names: Shi
  given-names: Ruibing
  email: ruibingshi@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/RuibingS/MS1Match_Rpackage
url: https://ruibings.github.io/MS1Match_Rpackage
contact:
- family-names: Shi
  given-names: Ruibing
  email: ruibingshi@gmail.com
keywords:
- feature-annotation
- lc-ms
- ms1
- untargeted-metabolomics
